{"title":"The Villain Wants To Live","synopsis":"Oleh penulis <The Novel's Extra>:\nMiddle-biss daru dari game kelas AAA yang diproduksi oleh perusahaan.\nVillainyang mati 999 dari 1.000 kali. Deculein.\n\nOrang itu sekarang, adalah aku.\n“Kau akan mati di hampir semua rute.”\n\nDeculein, seperti semua Villain lainnya, pasti mati.\n[Tujuan bertahan hidup yang pertama dan terpenting: Jadilah apa yang dituntut oleh Game]\n\nAku harus bertahan hidup meskipun itu berarti memutarbalikkan nasibku jika aku memang ditakdirkan untuk mati.","alternative_title":"악당은 살고 싶다","author":"","artist":"","genres":["Action"],"chapters":[{"id":"9de43e26-f77b-402a-9fce-7ae397fef805","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"74d2a2a3-f5e7-4555-ba5e-c2ef1503e876","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"3c3e6773-fa0f-4311-965c-820aaa3289fd","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"id":"8d4e130e-6fde-4a02-8680-2718deedb892","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-07-05","images":[]},{"id":"0dd53921-9348-40df-8c96-7333a91c8e8f","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"9550240d-7627-47cc-9daf-fb34e565271d","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"78a00acd-7b43-474a-9127-f3dd4c05ce20","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"id":"df11d3e8-7cca-4243-945f-912071c63f5a","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"id":"21242efe-17b0-4971-9af3-2a89157d6ff1","number":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"4c57b01c-66f1-4708-b499-36e44e5961a1","number":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-04-18","images":[]},{"id":"7f211e6b-8a62-4f89-a2f2-c487d198ef2b","number":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-04-10","images":[]},{"id":"2482c01c-b24c-462e-8cc5-35213493d777","number":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"2d9543cc-c22